Platos
======

Platos is an open-source agent runtime platform maintained by Winsen Labs.

Platos is built on top of, and incorporates code from, the trigger.dev project.
See the LICENSE file for the full MIT license terms that apply to upstream
trigger.dev code and to Platos additions.

