distributed under the same MIT license for consistency with the upstream work.

Dependencies:
  This project depends on numerous third-party open-source libraries. See
  package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml for the full list. Each dependency retains
  its own license — browse node_modules/*/LICENSE or run `pnpm licenses list`
  for details.

If you believe any attribution is missing or incorrect, please open an issue
at https://github.com/winsenlabs/platos/issues or email security@platos.dev.
